      "description": "Answers \"what is my unused, leftover or expiring API credit worth?\" for one provider or plan. Pass a plan (claude_max, chatgpt_pro_200) or a provider with monthlyCreditUsd. Returns a plain summary and an upper bound per month from the last 24 hours of Surplus sales; the lower bound is always $0 and nothing is guaranteed. Relay the summary and its caveats, not just the number. Never pass an API key.",
